<name>SRS Airbag</name>
<ttl id="1000Y_S0012_744XR_T009C" variety="T009C">
<name>Spiral Cable Sub-assembly</name>
<para id="RM000000QFF008X" category="G" type-id="3001K" name-id="554I2-00" from="200612">
<name>Component Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM000000QFF008X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM000000QFF008X_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___000050R00000">
<ptxt>Spiral Cable Sub-assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Set the spiral cable to the center position. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000QFE009X_02_0046"/>)</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the resistance between each terminal of the spiral cable under the following conditions.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C161568" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
<s3>
<ptxt>After setting the spiral cable to the center position, perform the inspection at the positions turned 2.5 turns clockwise and 2.5 turns counterclockwise.</ptxt>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Set the spiral cable to the position turned 2.5 turns clockwise from the center position, and perform the inspection while turning it 5.0 turns counterclockwise.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Resistance</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>D1(D+)-E2(D+)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>D2(D-)-E1(D-)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Do not turn the spiral cable 2.5 or more turns left or right from the center mark, as it may break.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
